# On Home, alice's other device says something the agent does not answer in the chat: the station says so (⚠, the
# fake claude only echoes), and the core says to show a notice that something went wrong (failed). Tapped, the chat
# opens at what the station said.
timeout 90000
until 端到端测试
log do: peer send 这一条不会有回复 {T}
timeout 150000
noticed 出错 ·
shot 1-home
timeout 30000
notice 出错 ·
until 发消息
shot 2-chat
back
until 端到端测试
